/S /P
/P 261 0 R
/E (The Student Council Election Tally System is a computer program that helps schools run student council elections more easily and accurately. Instead of counting votes by hand, this system lets students vote online and automatically counts the results.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
