103 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 262 0 R
/E (The system has two main users: students, who log in and vote for their preferred candidates, and administrators, who add candidates, manage the election, and view the final results. To keep the election fair, the system makes sure each student can only vote once.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
